Tips
When viewing tasks, use enumerate() to show numbered items nicely:
for index, task in enumerate(tasks, start=1):
    print(index, task)
Handle removing a task that doesn't exist in the list (it would normally crash with ValueError) — check with if task in tasks: before removing, or use try/except.

Bonus (optional)
Add a "Mark as done" option that doesn't remove the task, but shows it differently (e.g. with a ✅ or strikethrough-style prefix).
